  is not permission to use it.
type: software
authors:
  # An ORCID identifies a person, and the CFF schema only permits the field on a
  # person entry — family-names/given-names — not on an entity `name:`. The name
  # here now matches the creator .zenodo.json already carried.
  - family-names: Rouschev
    given-names: Tsvetan
    email: node@zeropoint.bg
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-7312-9778"
# The CONCEPT doi, not the version doi. 10.5281/zenodo.22178675 always resolves
# to the newest release; 10.5281/zenodo.22178676 is pinned to 1.0.15 and will be
# wrong the moment there is a 1.0.16. Cite the one that stays true.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22178675
identifiers:
